\[
R_T\le R_T^H+\delta_T(H).
\]
Also \(\delta_T(H)\le \Delta_T(H)\le T\beta(H)\) when \(\beta\) is available.
Known gaps: Need decide whether final theorem should use \(\delta\) only, or keep \(\Delta\) for easier estimation.
