\[
V_L=1/2,\quad V_H=3/4,\quad \sup_a (g_L(a)+g_H(a))/2=1/2.
\]
Bayes gap under the uniform prior is \(5/8-1/2=1/8\) per early round, hence \(D/8\). Yao gives a world with regret at least \(D/8\).
